<BODY>

<SPAN class="headline">Ordo Ursi Prismatus Login</span><P>

<P>

<H4>New Members</H4>

In order to add your information to the guild database, please enter the password provided to you by one of the guild officers.

<FORM action="guildlogin.php" method=POST name="new_member">

	<INPUT type="hidden" name="username" value="guildpass">

	Password:<INPUT type="password" name="pass" length=12 maxlength=12><BR>

	<INPUT type="submit" value="Submit" name="submit_new">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<INPUT type="reset" value="Clear">

</form>



<P>



<H4>Existing Members</h4>

Please enter your user name and password in the boxes below.<BR>

<FORM action="userlogin.php" method=POST name="existing_member">

	Username:<INPUT type="text" name="username" length=20 maxlength=20><BR>

	Password:<INPUT type="password" name="pass" length=12 maxlength=12><BR>

	<INPUT type="submit" value="Submit" name="submit_member">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<INPUT type="reset" value="Clear">

</form>

<P>

